<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>good girl</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">yustyna</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6bORz6pHNuhIF6c94cC1bl</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.140" end="00:06.250">I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.250" end="00:09.910">Can tell what's on your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.910" end="00:13.960">You don't want me to be kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.960" end="00:19.280">You wanna shake the roof of this hotel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.280" end="00:21.360">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.360" end="00:25.390">Don't have to tell me twice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.390" end="00:28.970">I'd choke you if you'd like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.970" end="00:33.460">A different side of you in a hotel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.460" end="00:37.680">'Cause I want it to be secret, no one knows how good you feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.680" end="00:41.040">Bite me on the neck, and then you whisper something real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.040" end="00:44.820">"I love you, my darling"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.820" end="00:48.020">You vampire, keep talking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.020" end="00:50.880">You tell me you're a good girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.880" end="00:55.270">But you don't see the way you fuckin' move, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.270" end="00:59.240">You make me feel so good, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.240" end="01:02.460">Now, promise you'll be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.460" end="01:06.150">You're such a lovely girl (you're such a good girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.150" end="01:10.040">But they don't see the way you fuckin' move, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.040" end="01:14.210">You're such a lovely girl (you're such a good girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.210" end="01:17.460">Now promise you'll be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.460" end="01:19.010">You're such a lovely girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.010" end="01:21.970">Sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.970" end="01:25.430">I love to watch you peak</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.430" end="01:29.480">You moan somethin' obscene</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.480" end="01:33.610">It sounds beautiful to me, to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.610" end="01:37.940">'Cause I want it to get messy, I can't help the way you feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.940" end="01:41.220">Fuck you in the Mustang while you're screaming something real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.220" end="01:44.610">"I love you, my darling"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.610" end="01:48.660">I'm your cowboy, keep driving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.660" end="01:51.260">Tell me you're a good girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.260" end="01:55.850">But they don't see the way you fuckin' move, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.850" end="01:59.610">You make me feel so good, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.610" end="02:02.770">Now, promise you'll be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.770" end="02:06.320">You're such a lovely girl (you're such a good girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.320" end="02:10.590">But they don't see the way you fuckin' move, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.590" end="02:14.630">You're such a lovely girl (you're such a good girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.630" end="02:18.020">Now promise you'll be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.020" end="02:21.570">You're such a lovely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.570" end="02:24.990">Girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.990" end="02:27.910">Mhm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.910" end="02:31.910" /></div></body></tt>